        "action:n1"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "To begin the process for Wiggo Company,"
      ],
      "justification": "Captures the starting point of the process and represents it both structurally as an init event and explicitly as an action."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n2",
        "action:n3"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "check the authority to make a purchase."
      ],
      "justification": "Captures the check step. The model redundantly frames it twice (as an instruction and as a question), which is a behaviourally harmless modeling choice."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->n5"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the response is \"okay\","
